[Audio:title-tune:Title Tune]
Played by #R$BB21 while the menu is shown, until a key is pressed.
The music data is at #R$C1E9.

#AUDIO0(title-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(TitleTune))

[Audio:start-tune:Start Tune]
Played by #R$BBA7 when a game is started.
The music data is at #R$C289.

#AUDIO0(start-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(StartTune))

[Audio:level-complete-tune:Level Complete Tune]
Played by #R$9A62 when a round has been won.
The music data is at #R$C2A7.

#AUDIO0(level-complete-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(LevelCompleteTune))

[Audio:game-over-tune:Game Over Tune]
Played by #R$9A39 and #R$9AE2 when the game is lost.
The music data is at #R$C2E9.

#AUDIO0(game-over-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(GameOverTune))

